    "text": "def max_fill_problem(grid, capacity):\n    count = 0\n    n = len(grid)\n    \n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(n):\n            if  grid_copy[i][j] == 1:\n                count += 1\n                if\n                count += capacity\n                else:\n                    return count\n\n    return count\n\n\"\"\"\nThis solution uses a greedy approach to count the number of 1s in each well,\nand then divides the sum of the counted values by the capacity to get the number of buckets.\n",
